  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let att formulera en fem&#xe5;rig strategisk handlingsplan f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;v&#xe5;rdsmyndigheten (EQA). Insatsen kommer finansiera upphandlingen av en konsult som skall hj&#xe4;lpa EQA att ta fram denna plan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this consultancy task is to facilitate,      mentor and support a working group in formulating a five-year         strategic action plan for the EQA which will support them to perform  their mission in the most efficient manner, having in mind the        constraints and parameters of the local context.</narrative>
  </description>
